cpm          Shared CP/M commands, installed helpers, INI and history
7XTGVTRM.BUF Live command-history buffers
7XTGVTRM.INI Live terminal/display/profile configuration
ASM.COM      Digital Research 8080 assembler: ASM NAME -> HEX/PRN
CAL.COM      Imported calendar utility
CARDMARK.COM Hardware card benchmark; unsupported on desktop
CLS.COM      Clear terminal screen
CONSOLE7.COM Select 7-bit console characters
CONSOLE8.COM Select 8-bit console characters
DDT.COM      Digital Research debugger
DRV.7XF      Remembered per-drive selections (runtime state)
DUMP.COM     Display file bytes in hexadecimal
ED.COM       CP/M line editor
EXIT.COM     Exit host RunCPM; desktop closes its session
FORMAT.COM   RunCPM drive-folder creation; not a raw disk formatter
INFO.COM     Imported drive-info utility; not the 7XF catalog editor
LOAD.COM     Convert Intel HEX to COM: LOAD NAME
LU.COM       Library/archive utility
MBASIC.COM   Microsoft BASIC working interpreter (patched 5.30)
MOVCPM.COM   Historical CP/M relocation utility; not firmware installation
PIP.COM      Copy files; normal CP/M drive/user rules apply
REBOOT.COM   Request firmware/desktop restart
REFLASH.COM  Request configured hardware reflash; not for desktop
RSTAT.COM    RunCPM-specific status utility
SPEED.COM    RunCPM CPU speed/throttling command
STAT.COM     CP/M file/device status
SUBMIT.COM   Run a SUB command script
SUBMITD.COM  Imported SUBMIT variant; exact differences not audited
SYSGEN.COM   Historical CP/M system utility; not firmware installation
TE.COM       TE full-screen text editor
TINST.COM    Configure Turbo Pascal terminal; modifies installation data
TURBO.COM    Turbo Pascal 3.01 compiler/editor
UNARC.COM    Extract ARC archives
UNCR.COM     Uncrunch compressed files
UNSUB.COM    Cancel pending SUBMIT queue in the current area
UNZIP.COM    Extract ZIP archives
UNZIP157.COM Alternate UNZIP 1.57
USQ.COM      Unsqueeze compressed files
VOL.7XF      Global drive descriptions for 7XF
VT100.COM    Return to ANSI/VT100 mode
VT52.COM     Enter VT52 mode (VT100 returns to ANSI)
VTCPU.COM    Active and quiet Z80 interpreter benchmark
VTCPU8X.COM  8080/8085-compatible instruction-loop benchmark
VTDRV.COM    Read/verify disk fixture; W recreates it; Q quiet timing
VTDRV8X.COM  8080/8085-compatible disk benchmark
VTGET.COM    Read a guest file for host download
VTINFO.COM   Report board, build, terminal geometry and zoom presets
VTPAL.COM    Select palette 0..9
VTPUT.COM    Receive a host upload into a guest file
VTTERM.COM   Run firmware native text-parser test through private port
VTZOOM.COM   Set/query logical terminal size and zoom preset
XMODEM.COM   Historical XMODEM utility
XSUB.COM     SUBMIT input support
Z80ASM.COM   SLR Z80 assembler: Z80ASM NAME -> COM from NAME.Z80
ZOOM.COM     Small legacy zoom command; prefer VTZOOM
